 col←readStructColumn(vector column_type row_count);child_count;child_names;child_vectors;child_cols;i;j
⍝ Read a STRUCT column from a DuckDB vector
⍝ vector: the DuckDB vector pointer
⍝ column_type: the logical type of the column
⍝ row_count: number of rows
⍝ Returns: vector of namespaces (one per struct)

⎕io←0

⍝ Get struct metadata
child_count←api.duckdb_struct_type_child_count column_type
child_names←{256 read.utf8 api.duckdb_struct_type_child_name column_type ⍵}¨⍳child_count

⍝ Get child vectors and read their data
child_vectors←{api.duckdb_struct_vector_get_child vector ⍵}¨⍳child_count
child_cols←{
    child_vec←⍵
    child_type←api.duckdb_vector_get_column_type child_vec
    child_type_id←api.duckdb_get_type_id child_type
    child_data←api.duckdb_vector_get_data child_vec
    readChildElements child_vec child_type_id child_data row_count
}¨child_vectors

⍝ Build result: each row is a namespace with field names mapped to values
col←⎕NS¨row_count⍴⊂⍬
:For i :In ⍳row_count
    :For j :In ⍳child_count
        ⍎'col[i].',(j⊃child_names),'←⊃(j⊃child_cols)[i]'
    :EndFor
:EndFor

⍝ KSL 2.0.0
